WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:49.595
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:49.865 --> 01:51.705
Arrogant, are you?

3
01:52.705 --> 01:54.385
Got something to say?

4
01:54.465 --> 01:55.745
What's that look for?

5
01:56.345 --> 01:57.385
Are you mad?

6
02:00.025 --> 02:01.945
WU FA

7
02:22.105 --> 02:23.345
Useless.

8
02:28.145 --> 02:31.465
Who the hell are you calling useless? Useless?

9
02:31.545 --> 02:33.585
I'll show you useless! You're useless!

10
02:35.465 --> 02:36.585
Useless!

11
02:38.105 --> 02:41.185
Everyone goes to the lab to prepare for the competition.

12
02:41.265 --> 02:42.825
It's not as crowded at night.

13
02:42.905 --> 02:45.105
I'm going to the lab to get some data.

14
02:46.785 --> 02:47.825
That'll teach you.

15
02:53.225 --> 02:54.665
Hey!

16
03:07.145 --> 03:08.025
Zheng Yu.

17
03:09.305 --> 03:10.425
Are you okay?

18
03:37.385 --> 03:38.345
TRANSFERRING FILE

19
04:04.465 --> 04:06.065
There's only these here.

20
04:07.625 --> 04:08.905
Go to the hospital.

21
04:09.945 --> 04:10.785
No need.

22
04:11.545 --> 04:12.865
Winter clothing is thick.

23
04:13.425 --> 04:14.585
I'll be fine.

24
04:16.345 --> 04:18.825
You call that bit of clothing thick?

25
04:22.064 --> 04:24.585
Help me out. Take a photo of the back of my neck.

26
04:41.345 --> 04:42.505
Done.

27
04:48.465 --> 04:49.465
It's blurry.

28
04:50.065 --> 04:53.145
My hair is blocking half of it. Can you do it properly?

29
04:54.785 --> 04:55.865
What use is this?

30
04:56.745 --> 04:58.185
Go to the hospital.

31
04:58.265 --> 04:59.785
Get a medical assessment.

32
05:01.185 --> 05:02.025
No need.

33
05:03.505 --> 05:04.505
Is it about money?

34
05:05.505 --> 05:07.265
-If so, I can-- -Can you take the photo or not?

35
05:52.625 --> 05:53.865
Done yet?

36
06:17.145 --> 06:18.545
Why didn't you dodge, run,

37
06:18.625 --> 06:19.945
or scream for help?

38
06:21.705 --> 06:23.665
What if he kept beating you?

39
06:23.745 --> 06:25.185
It could've been dangerous.

40
06:26.225 --> 06:27.505
I can't believe

41
06:27.585 --> 06:30.585
someone who has a weak heart but still wants to play football

42
06:30.665 --> 06:31.585
cherishes life.

43
06:38.385 --> 06:40.185
Fighting back would have been useless.

44
06:41.785 --> 06:43.465
From the first punch,

45
06:44.505 --> 06:46.785
I could feel how strong he was.

46
06:49.385 --> 06:50.305
So what do you

47
06:51.065 --> 06:51.905
plan to do?

48
06:53.305 --> 06:54.305
Private settlement.

49
06:54.945 --> 06:57.025
If you want to negotiate compensation,

50
06:57.105 --> 06:58.585
you need to find him first.

51
06:58.665 --> 07:00.185
Stay out of it.

52
07:00.785 --> 07:01.625
I have my ways.

53
07:07.985 --> 07:09.985
You were going to the lab, weren't you?

54
07:10.065 --> 07:10.905
Go on.

55
07:13.305 --> 07:14.825
I don't have an umbrella.

56
07:32.745 --> 07:33.945
Fifty-eight yuan each.

57
07:34.025 --> 07:34.945
Buying one?

58
07:38.745 --> 07:39.865
There's no cheap ones left.

59
08:14.225 --> 08:15.785
You should get examined.

60
08:16.665 --> 08:18.265
What if you have a bone injury?

61
08:18.345 --> 08:19.865
ZHENG YU

62
08:24.025 --> 08:26.745
Are you really short on money?

63
08:32.865 --> 08:33.745
All bullshit.

64
08:42.705 --> 08:46.265
SELLING PERFUME (MINOR FLAW) ON RQ SECONDHAND GOODS

65
09:04.545 --> 09:05.585
You came.

66
09:20.745 --> 09:22.785
Accidentally made too much.

67
10:25.785 --> 10:29.585
CONGRATULATIONS, YOUR ITEM HAS BEEN SOLD!

68
10:44.505 --> 10:45.945
Happy birthday.

69
10:47.985 --> 10:49.305
Birthday?

70
10:51.545 --> 10:54.945
I saw in your profile that your birthday is today.

71
10:58.945 --> 11:00.465
I randomly filled it in.

72
11:07.465 --> 11:08.545
Thank you.

73
11:12.425 --> 11:14.065
This perfume smells really good.

74
11:14.145 --> 11:15.905
When you first spray it,

75
11:15.985 --> 11:17.625
it smells like the rain.

76
11:18.385 --> 11:19.345
After ten minutes,

77
11:19.945 --> 11:22.025
it transforms into the warmth of sunshine.

78
11:24.545 --> 11:26.985
Then what are the base notes?

79
11:35.225 --> 11:36.745
I couldn't find that online.

80
11:39.145 --> 11:41.585
LI YANAN

81
11:43.225 --> 11:44.265
Hello?

82
11:44.345 --> 11:45.705
Have you arrived on campus?

83
11:46.745 --> 11:49.065
You suddenly stopped replying after a while.

84
11:50.665 --> 11:51.825
Something happened.

85
11:51.905 --> 11:52.745
What happened?

86
11:56.945 --> 11:58.025
I saw someone.

87
11:59.705 --> 12:02.705
Someone who seems to never be able to catch a break.

88
12:07.665 --> 12:09.025
She seems

89
12:09.105 --> 12:10.745
to carry the weight of the world.

90
12:12.065 --> 12:14.945
But when you're wondering

91
12:15.025 --> 12:18.065
how she even breathes beneath that weight,

92
12:18.585 --> 12:20.145
she starts running.

93
12:22.145 --> 12:25.345
Why does this person sound so familiar?

94
12:27.705 --> 12:29.505
Is there a mirror in the lab?

95
12:29.585 --> 12:31.985
Look in the mirror and you'll see such a person.

96
12:34.025 --> 12:35.065
I can't talk anymore.

97
12:35.145 --> 12:36.705
I really have to go to the lab.

98
12:37.865 --> 12:40.425
Try being friends with that person.

99
12:40.505 --> 12:42.425
It's my most genuine piece of advice.

100
12:42.505 --> 12:43.345
All right.

101
12:43.425 --> 12:45.505
Get to work. Remember to rest.

102
12:56.505 --> 12:57.545
Friends?

103
13:06.545 --> 13:12.385
JI HENG HOSPITAL OF QINGYI CITY

104
14:24.025 --> 14:25.305
Ms. Zheng.

105
14:30.745 --> 14:31.985
Where's my work badge?

106
14:33.825 --> 14:35.025
Hey!

107
14:38.705 --> 14:40.745
"NingSheng BioTech."

108
14:41.905 --> 14:42.985
Sounds very familiar.

109
14:47.505 --> 14:49.865
It's my habit to record conversations

110
14:49.945 --> 14:51.305
with my employees.

111
14:51.385 --> 14:52.865
I hope you don't mind.

112
14:53.785 --> 14:55.665
No wonder you could become a director.

113
14:57.225 --> 14:58.665
So what if I'm a director?

114
14:59.265 --> 15:00.345
We're all the same.

115
15:00.425 --> 15:01.905
We all work for someone else.

116
15:01.985 --> 15:04.945
The only difference is that we just look rather--

117
15:05.025 --> 15:06.665
Let's get back to business.

118
15:08.825 --> 15:11.025
I sent you the surveillance footage.

119
15:11.865 --> 15:14.305
I don't need to play it again

120
15:14.905 --> 15:16.185
in this public area, do I?

121
15:22.385 --> 15:23.665
No need.

122
15:23.745 --> 15:25.065
Well,

123
15:25.145 --> 15:26.105
I…

124
15:26.185 --> 15:28.545
end up like that when I drink too much.

125
15:29.145 --> 15:30.425
I did it in a daze.

126
15:31.025 --> 15:32.185
Don't take it to heart.

127
15:33.345 --> 15:34.825
You seemed quite clear-headed.

128
15:36.065 --> 15:39.905
Who would do such a thing while sober? It does no one any good, right?

129
15:40.745 --> 15:42.705
In fact, to be honest,

130
15:42.785 --> 15:45.825
that day, my boss gave me a dressing-down.

131
15:45.905 --> 15:47.745
Her words were so nasty.

132
15:47.825 --> 15:50.265
As a grown man, how could I tolerate that?

133
15:50.825 --> 15:53.385
So I drank and just lost control.

134
15:53.465 --> 15:55.505
Why didn't you beat your boss?

135
15:55.585 --> 15:56.785
That…

136
15:56.865 --> 15:57.825
My boss is a woman.

137
15:57.905 --> 15:59.305
How could I possibly…

138
16:03.385 --> 16:04.625
"In a daze,"

139
16:04.705 --> 16:07.745
but you knew to take it out on someone lower in the hierarchy.

140
16:08.345 --> 16:09.665
"Lost control,"

141
16:09.745 --> 16:12.225
but when you saw a man approaching, you fled.

142
16:13.865 --> 16:15.705
This alcohol you drank

143
16:15.785 --> 16:17.145
sure is something special.

144
16:20.225 --> 16:21.185
Ms. Zheng,

145
16:21.265 --> 16:23.745
we're here to discuss compensation, right?

146
16:24.585 --> 16:25.825
Yes.

147
16:25.905 --> 16:28.185
On the phone, you demanded 18,000 yuan.

148
16:28.265 --> 16:29.345
Isn't it a bit much?

149
16:30.225 --> 16:32.385
I assumed you were badly injured.

150
16:32.465 --> 16:34.825
But from the look of you, you seem fine.

151
16:34.905 --> 16:35.865
Here's what I mean.

152
16:36.465 --> 16:38.785
I'm paying off a mortgage, and I have kids.

153
16:38.865 --> 16:39.985
My wife doesn't work.

154
16:40.065 --> 16:41.385
Any promotion is far off.

155
16:41.465 --> 16:43.705
So I'm not as well-off as you think.

156
16:46.985 --> 16:48.665
If you lose your job,

157
16:49.585 --> 16:51.305
will you be better off?

158
17:00.425 --> 17:02.865
SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT

159
17:16.865 --> 17:19.825
So you're the type of person who can be bought off.

160
17:21.025 --> 17:22.865
So what if I punched you a few times?

161
17:27.704 --> 17:30.345
Wow. You even brought help?

162
17:34.985 --> 17:36.425
Don't forget to pay the bill.

163
17:37.345 --> 17:38.705
That table's too.

164
18:14.865 --> 18:15.945
This is for you.

165
18:16.945 --> 18:19.225
Place it somewhere sunny.

166
18:19.945 --> 18:21.105
Its flowers last a long time.

167
18:22.025 --> 18:23.065
Don't follow me.

168
18:47.425 --> 18:48.625
What are you doing?

169
18:50.065 --> 18:51.025
There you are.

170
18:51.105 --> 18:52.425
Find a seat.

171
18:52.505 --> 18:54.225
What else could we be doing?

172
18:54.745 --> 18:58.785
We came, so of course we had to bond with Zhen

173
18:58.865 --> 19:00.665
and massage her shoulders and legs.

174
19:00.745 --> 19:01.745
Oh, right.

175
19:01.825 --> 19:04.265
I helped you dust off the head of the bed.

176
19:10.745 --> 19:12.425
I've sent you the money.

177
19:12.505 --> 19:13.545
Leave immediately.

178
19:16.505 --> 19:18.345
ZHENG YU TRANSFERRED 25,000 YUAN

179
19:20.345 --> 19:22.025
You're in college now.

180
19:22.105 --> 19:23.625
How come your math

181
19:23.705 --> 19:25.305
is worse than before?

182
19:27.065 --> 19:29.505
I'll send the last 5,000 yuan as soon as possible.

183
19:32.825 --> 19:33.745
Zheng Yu,

184
19:34.625 --> 19:36.745
you don't really think

185
19:36.825 --> 19:39.225
you only owe us 5,000 yuan, do you?

186
19:41.505 --> 19:44.185
All these years, you took your mother to get treatment.

187
19:45.025 --> 19:46.145
I thought

188
19:46.225 --> 19:50.225
she would at least be able to move her eyes or twitch her lips by now.

189
19:50.305 --> 19:51.745
But being here today, I see

190
19:51.825 --> 19:54.505
that all your money has gone down the drain.

191
19:56.385 --> 19:58.025
And these books.

192
19:58.665 --> 20:00.905
What a stack! No wonder you're a top student.

193
20:02.305 --> 20:04.505
These books must have cost a fortune.

194
20:06.185 --> 20:07.305
Why don't you consider

195
20:07.385 --> 20:09.745
saving the money spent on books

196
20:10.425 --> 20:12.025
and giving it to us?

197
20:12.105 --> 20:12.945
Stop it.

198
20:13.665 --> 20:14.625
This is a hospital.

199
20:17.625 --> 20:18.665
Girl,

200
20:19.185 --> 20:21.065
you should just stop living like this.

201
20:21.145 --> 20:23.065
We've known each other for years.

202
20:23.145 --> 20:23.985
Here's an idea.

203
20:32.985 --> 20:34.225
Go away!

204
20:35.745 --> 20:37.145
You're just too young

205
20:37.225 --> 20:38.745
and not ruthless enough.

206
20:39.505 --> 20:40.985
Get lost.

207
20:41.585 --> 20:42.545
Leave!

208
20:46.025 --> 20:47.345
That's all for today.

209
20:50.745 --> 20:52.545
Saddled with this half-dead person,

210
20:52.625 --> 20:53.985
you're just wasting money.

211
20:54.065 --> 20:56.105
Plan ahead and buy a burial plot for her.

212
20:59.145 --> 20:59.985
Are you crazy?

213
21:00.065 --> 21:01.945
Don't. This is a hospital.

214
21:36.385 --> 21:37.625
Zheng Yu!

215
21:38.945 --> 21:40.345
What are you all doing?

216
21:40.425 --> 21:42.385
Are you the patient's family?

217
21:42.985 --> 21:44.745
-Get out! Leave! -You just wait.

218
21:44.825 --> 21:45.665
Get out!

219
21:49.305 --> 21:52.065
Break it up! Nothing to see here!

220
21:52.145 --> 21:53.185
Zheng Yu.

221
22:18.785 --> 22:19.625
From Ms. Yang.

222
22:19.705 --> 22:21.545
CHOCOLATE MILK

223
22:28.505 --> 22:29.945
Instead of getting treatment,

224
22:30.025 --> 22:32.225
you asked me to take photos of your injuries.

225
22:32.305 --> 22:34.105
So it was for leverage.

226
22:38.825 --> 22:40.625
The compensation money

227
22:40.705 --> 22:43.065
was for those two people in the ward.

228
22:43.145 --> 22:44.705
Chen Yanzhou,

229
22:45.625 --> 22:47.265
haven't you crossed a line?

230
22:48.585 --> 22:50.025
You followed me to the café

231
22:50.105 --> 22:51.905
and saw me demand money from him.

232
22:51.985 --> 22:52.825
That's fine.

233
22:53.425 --> 22:56.785
Then you followed me to the hospital and saw me looking so pathetic.

234
22:58.945 --> 23:00.225
I wanted to bring flowers.

235
23:02.705 --> 23:03.865
As a friend.

236
23:06.425 --> 23:07.585
Friend?

237
23:09.705 --> 23:10.825
Are we friends?

238
23:12.985 --> 23:15.825
I would rather you treat me as a rival,

239
23:15.905 --> 23:19.145
someone who can benefit you as a teammate,

240
23:20.025 --> 23:22.385
than a pitiful classmate.

241
23:28.865 --> 23:31.025
LU SIQUAN

242
23:32.585 --> 23:33.665
I'm busy. I'm leaving.

243
23:52.705 --> 23:54.185
Sorry, I…

244
23:54.265 --> 23:55.905
You what?

245
23:55.985 --> 23:58.345
Didn't I tell you to be punctual?

246
23:58.425 --> 24:00.745
Is it so hard to notify me if you're busy?

247
24:00.825 --> 24:03.425
I tolerated you barely coming in on time before.

248
24:03.505 --> 24:05.585
Today you were a no-show! What's with that?

249
24:08.465 --> 24:09.745
It won't happen again.

250
24:10.345 --> 24:12.465
I was 35 minutes late this time.

251
24:12.545 --> 24:14.225
Dock my pay as we agreed.

252
24:14.305 --> 24:15.825
Of course I'll deduct it!

253
24:15.905 --> 24:17.385
It's double, as we agreed.

254
24:19.785 --> 24:21.465
You asked for more shifts.

255
24:21.545 --> 24:22.585
I gave them to you.

256
24:22.665 --> 24:23.945
Is this how you handle it?

257
24:27.665 --> 24:30.985
And I don't want to know how you got that injury on your face.

258
24:31.065 --> 24:34.185
But if you're in some trouble out there, I'm not keeping you.

259
24:34.265 --> 24:36.825
If you really need money, then behave.

260
24:36.905 --> 24:39.705
Send another 20,000 yuan before semester starts.

261
24:39.785 --> 24:43.025
Otherwise, every day of the new semester

262
24:43.105 --> 24:45.145
will be just like today.

263
24:45.225 --> 24:46.065
WU FA

264
24:48.585 --> 24:49.745
Are you listening?

265
24:52.505 --> 24:53.385
What's wrong?

266
24:54.065 --> 24:55.185
Can't take a scolding?

267
24:56.345 --> 24:57.265
Go, hurry.

268
24:57.345 --> 24:59.625
Finish restocking the shelves.

269
25:00.225 --> 25:01.385
If you don't work hard,

270
25:01.465 --> 25:02.585
you can be replaced!

271
25:02.665 --> 25:04.385
Is being late a capital offense?

272
25:09.665 --> 25:11.865
This is the first time I've been late.

273
25:12.585 --> 25:14.465
I agreed to have my pay docked.

274
25:15.825 --> 25:18.305
Why do you still have to talk to me like this?

275
25:19.945 --> 25:22.145
Have you asked me why I'm late?

276
25:22.945 --> 25:25.105
Have you listened to me explain my injuries?

277
25:25.785 --> 25:27.465
If restocking was that urgent,

278
25:27.545 --> 25:29.745
why were you closing up to go home?

279
25:33.705 --> 25:35.185
You probably don't know

280
25:36.065 --> 25:37.425
that living a normal life

281
25:38.665 --> 25:40.185
is a form of good fortune.

282
25:43.505 --> 25:45.545
Why can't you fortunate people

283
25:46.585 --> 25:48.545
have a little more patience

284
25:48.625 --> 25:50.905
with unfortunate people like us?

285
25:52.065 --> 25:53.185
Dad.

286
25:57.065 --> 25:57.985
Dad.

287
26:01.425 --> 26:02.465
Dad.

288
26:03.385 --> 26:04.905
Son. Sir, I'm sorry.

289
26:04.985 --> 26:05.985
I'm late today.

290
26:06.065 --> 26:07.425
I'm sorry for being late.

291
26:07.505 --> 26:09.785
Mr. Lu, it's all right.

292
26:10.865 --> 26:12.385
It's only a 15-minute walk.

293
26:12.985 --> 26:15.505
I was going to wait with Xiaoyang at reception,

294
26:16.105 --> 26:17.185
but he was impatient.

295
26:17.265 --> 26:19.985
Maybe it's because you're usually on time.

296
26:20.065 --> 26:21.105
You were late today,

297
26:22.025 --> 26:22.945
so he was worried.

298
26:23.025 --> 26:25.025
I'm really sorry for troubling you.

299
26:25.105 --> 26:26.585
No, it's the least I could do.

300
26:27.425 --> 26:29.345
-I'll let you go. -Okay, take care.

301
26:32.345 --> 26:33.185
Son.

302
26:34.585 --> 26:35.585
Looking for cookies?

303
26:37.425 --> 26:39.905
Fruity yogurt milk is on the left.

304
26:39.985 --> 26:42.665
Bear cookies are behind it.

305
26:43.385 --> 26:45.385
-Fruity yogurt is right here! -Here!

306
26:46.225 --> 26:47.905
-Bear cookies… -Bear…

307
26:47.985 --> 26:50.905
-Bear cookies are right here. -I can't find them.

308
26:50.985 --> 26:51.905
-Dad. -Here you go.

309
26:51.985 --> 26:54.185
-I can't find them. -They're all yours.

310
26:54.265 --> 26:55.945
-Here, be careful. -Bear cookies!

311
26:56.025 --> 26:57.065
Come on.

312
27:26.585 --> 27:28.665
Bear cookies!

313
28:03.585 --> 28:05.065
If you want to fire me,

314
28:05.785 --> 28:06.825
I accept it.

315
28:08.145 --> 28:09.625
I haven't hired you yet.

316
28:09.705 --> 28:10.865
How can I fire you?

317
28:12.905 --> 28:14.825
GAO XING'S MOTHER

318
28:18.705 --> 28:19.985
Sorry about that.

319
28:20.625 --> 28:22.585
What were you calling about?

320
28:22.665 --> 28:23.985
Ms. Xiaozheng,

321
28:24.065 --> 28:25.505
during this winter break,

322
28:25.585 --> 28:27.265
Gao Xing will be in your care.

323
28:32.185 --> 28:35.025
So what happened with you and your friend?

324
28:35.105 --> 28:36.065
What friend?

325
28:36.825 --> 28:39.545
The one who can never catch a break.

326
28:43.665 --> 28:44.745
Nothing.

327
28:44.825 --> 28:46.825
We're incompatible. We can't be friends.

328
28:46.905 --> 28:48.745
If it's not thesis-related, then bye.

329
29:14.905 --> 29:15.945
Coming.

330
29:22.745 --> 29:24.065
Come on in.

331
29:30.905 --> 29:32.665
-Here. -Thank you.

332
29:57.625 --> 29:58.745
Ms. Xiaozheng,

333
30:01.305 --> 30:03.545
I will be away on business for a while.

334
30:03.625 --> 30:07.505
A helper will come over to cook and clean regularly.

335
30:07.585 --> 30:08.905
But the rest of the time,

336
30:08.985 --> 30:10.865
I want to ask you to spend more time

337
30:12.465 --> 30:13.425
with Gao Xing.

338
30:15.905 --> 30:18.625
You're both young. You're sure to get along, right?

339
30:20.945 --> 30:22.945
If there is any problem, message me.

340
30:23.785 --> 30:25.465
Wages are paid daily, right?

341
30:27.065 --> 30:28.225
Of course.

342
30:37.025 --> 30:37.985
I'm coming in.

343
30:51.145 --> 30:52.625
I accidentally tripped.

344
30:53.665 --> 30:55.545
Did you do the homework I assigned?

345
30:56.265 --> 30:57.425
All done.

346
31:01.985 --> 31:02.865
Not bad.

347
31:03.465 --> 31:05.465
At least you were willing to spend time

348
31:05.545 --> 31:06.505
copying answers.

349
31:11.785 --> 31:13.985
Senior high school biology isn't hard.

350
31:14.065 --> 31:15.585
Rote memorization is the key.

351
31:15.665 --> 31:17.265
You're a Qing Yi University student.

352
31:17.345 --> 31:18.865
Junior, Life Sciences.

353
31:18.945 --> 31:21.425
However, it's not just memorizing terms.

354
31:21.505 --> 31:23.465
Instead, you go from the "what"

355
31:23.545 --> 31:24.785
to the "why" and "how."

356
31:24.865 --> 31:27.505
Does your college have a lot of really smart people?

357
31:27.585 --> 31:30.225
So you have to understand the underlying logic.

358
31:30.305 --> 31:31.705
-Do you know-- -Gao Xing.

359
31:31.785 --> 31:35.345
Did your mom hire me to chit-chat with you?

360
31:35.425 --> 31:38.945
She would be happy to hire someone who could get along with me.

361
31:51.545 --> 31:52.905
Let's begin the lesson.

362
32:22.345 --> 32:24.425
LU SIQUAN

363
32:26.185 --> 32:28.305
-Hello? -Why aren't you here yet?

364
32:28.385 --> 32:30.505
Are you thinking of skipping again?

365
32:36.825 --> 32:38.145
I'm still on the way.

366
32:38.905 --> 32:39.865
I'll be there soon.

367
32:40.705 --> 32:41.585
Hurry up.

368
33:09.665 --> 33:11.025
Check your watch.

369
33:11.105 --> 33:12.305
What time is it now?

370
33:12.985 --> 33:14.185
You're getting bold,

371
33:14.265 --> 33:16.065
leaving without a word.

372
33:17.745 --> 33:18.785
I thought

373
33:19.385 --> 33:21.425
you didn't want to see me anymore.

374
33:22.505 --> 33:24.865
Stop standing there. Get changed and start work.

375
33:27.905 --> 33:29.625
Always wasting time.

376
33:40.425 --> 33:41.625
Thank you.

377
33:56.145 --> 33:58.025
Okay, that's about it.

378
33:58.105 --> 34:02.825
Just go home and find some time to revise the parts I talked about.

379
34:02.905 --> 34:03.985
-Okay. -Okay. Bye, sir.

380
34:04.065 --> 34:06.505
-Happy Lunar New Year. -Happy Lunar New Year, sir. Bye.

381
34:11.985 --> 34:14.985
You don't have to join the Spring Festival travel rush.

382
34:15.065 --> 34:16.304
Why do you come so often?

383
34:16.905 --> 34:18.145
I have a lot to do.

384
34:18.225 --> 34:20.304
You two finished the final draft early.

385
34:20.385 --> 34:21.744
There aren't many issues.

386
34:21.824 --> 34:23.705
It will come down to the defense.

387
34:24.545 --> 34:25.665
She should be fine.

388
34:27.185 --> 34:30.025
Even if you two split the work and she does the defense,

389
34:30.105 --> 34:32.625
you can't just wash your hands of it.

390
34:35.585 --> 34:36.665
That's how she prefers it.

391
34:37.744 --> 34:38.905
How can you say that?

392
34:38.985 --> 34:42.865
Two people in a partnership should help and support each other.

393
34:42.945 --> 34:45.225
You were accused of cheating.

394
34:45.304 --> 34:48.105
Zheng Yu chose to trust you and helped clear your name.

395
34:50.025 --> 34:51.065
Helped clear my name?

396
34:51.145 --> 34:52.225
Didn't you know?

397
34:54.025 --> 34:56.505
That Xie Yudi didn't want to help you.

398
34:56.585 --> 34:59.225
He only went to tell the advisor because of Zheng Yu.

399
34:59.305 --> 35:01.625
I heard it from your advisor.

400
35:02.225 --> 35:04.985
Zheng Yu is a very good kid.

401
35:05.065 --> 35:06.785
Her family is poor.

402
35:06.865 --> 35:08.465
If not for clearing your name,

403
35:08.545 --> 35:12.825
she could have pretended not to know and gotten the Vitality Award.

404
35:12.905 --> 35:14.905
I have plans. I have to go.

405
35:26.785 --> 35:27.825
Where are you?

406
35:28.545 --> 35:30.305
On my way to the old lab.

407
35:31.185 --> 35:32.185
Wait for me.

408
35:41.705 --> 35:42.745
Zheng Yu.

409
36:07.825 --> 36:08.665
What do you want?

410
36:11.185 --> 36:12.345
Thank you.

411
36:14.385 --> 36:16.345
You helped clear my name.

412
36:17.305 --> 36:20.345
I was helping myself in case it affected the competition.

413
36:22.105 --> 36:23.585
Really?

414
36:23.665 --> 36:24.545
Of course.

415
36:26.385 --> 36:29.585
If we win the Excellence Cup, things will be better, right?

416
36:33.025 --> 36:35.385
I mean for both of us.

417
36:36.545 --> 36:37.985
You'll get the prize money,

418
36:38.065 --> 36:41.225
and I can shut up those people who mocked me on the forum.

419
36:42.665 --> 36:43.545
What's your point?

420
36:45.585 --> 36:46.945
I followed you last time

421
36:47.025 --> 36:49.145
out of concern for you as a friend.

422
36:49.745 --> 36:52.345
But that made you uncomfortable.

423
36:53.225 --> 36:55.865
I should apologize to you. I'm sorry.

424
36:57.625 --> 36:59.825
That day, you said we aren't friends.

425
37:00.705 --> 37:04.185
But even if we can't be friends,

426
37:04.265 --> 37:06.705
we're at least comrades for now.

427
37:08.185 --> 37:09.185
So

428
37:09.265 --> 37:10.945
this time,

429
37:12.825 --> 37:14.385
let's win together.

430
38:25.145 --> 38:27.305
I sent you the latest version of the slides.

431
38:28.145 --> 38:29.265
I saw it.

432
38:29.345 --> 38:30.785
Leave the rest to me.

433
38:30.865 --> 38:33.385
You should enjoy the Lunar New Year.

434
38:34.065 --> 38:35.985
Contact me if you have any issues.

435
38:36.065 --> 38:36.945
I'll be online.

436
38:39.705 --> 38:41.385
Do you have plans for the holiday?

437
38:44.145 --> 38:45.345
The same as usual.

438
38:47.825 --> 38:50.145
Then I wish you happy holidays.

439
38:54.105 --> 38:55.345
Same to you.

440
39:09.185 --> 39:10.585
How is there so much stuff?

441
39:12.225 --> 39:14.865
Old bath towel, one, two.

442
39:15.625 --> 39:18.585
Zheng Yu, have you bought a ticket home?

443
39:20.025 --> 39:20.945
Not yet.

444
39:21.025 --> 39:22.465
Then you should hurry.

445
39:23.825 --> 39:25.465
We're all leaving today.

446
39:27.145 --> 39:28.785
Safe travels.

447
39:34.185 --> 39:37.425
Fangli, let me help you, or you will miss your flight.

448
39:37.505 --> 39:38.625
BIOLOGY REVIEW PROBLEMS

449
39:40.065 --> 39:42.345
We won't go over your mistakes today.

450
39:42.425 --> 39:43.265
We won't?

451
39:43.905 --> 39:45.825
It would take longer than one session.

452
39:47.945 --> 39:49.385
I'm not criticizing you.

453
39:49.985 --> 39:52.665
Discussing each problem would mean covering many different concepts.

454
39:52.745 --> 39:54.745
You wouldn't remember everything.

455
39:54.825 --> 39:57.225
So let's use a different approach.

456
39:59.705 --> 40:02.345
Here. I compiled these notes for you.

457
40:04.745 --> 40:06.465
You can find the answers in here

458
40:06.545 --> 40:08.705
or ask me up to three times.

459
40:08.785 --> 40:12.345
I'll give you 40 minutes to correct this exercise sheet.

460
40:13.225 --> 40:14.745
I can do it in ten minutes.

461
40:14.825 --> 40:16.145
I'll search online…

462
40:16.825 --> 40:19.505
You can only use the notebook. Use it every day.

463
40:20.545 --> 40:22.985
This is like an amusement park guidebook.

464
40:23.065 --> 40:25.745
Where is the carousel? Where is the roller coaster?

465
40:25.825 --> 40:27.225
Memorize everything.

466
40:27.305 --> 40:29.385
Because when it's time to go play,

467
40:29.465 --> 40:30.785
there is no GPS.

468
40:30.865 --> 40:31.785
I hate parks.

469
40:31.865 --> 40:32.825
It's a metaphor.

470
40:35.585 --> 40:36.825
Begin.

471
40:40.225 --> 40:41.665
PLANT CELL STRUCTURE

472
40:41.745 --> 40:42.745
SECRETORY PROTEINS

473
40:44.745 --> 40:49.065
These single-celled organisms…

474
40:49.705 --> 40:51.265
-I have a question. -Go ahead.

475
40:52.305 --> 40:55.185
Both paramecia and amoebas are single-celled organisms.

476
40:55.265 --> 40:57.785
So why is amoeba used to call someone dumb

477
40:57.865 --> 40:58.945
instead of paramecium?

478
41:01.265 --> 41:02.425
Is this relevant?

479
41:09.745 --> 41:10.585
Ms. Zheng,

480
41:10.665 --> 41:12.945
can you come a little later tomorrow?

481
41:13.545 --> 41:14.825
I'm not coming tomorrow.

482
41:15.385 --> 41:16.865
No way.

483
41:16.945 --> 41:18.665
Are you angry?

484
41:20.465 --> 41:22.665
Did you look at the lesson schedule?

485
41:25.585 --> 41:27.025
There is no lesson tomorrow.

486
41:27.625 --> 41:30.105
You should've said so!

487
41:30.745 --> 41:32.745
But I have two exam papers for you.

488
41:40.785 --> 41:42.465
GAO XING'S MOTHER

489
41:42.545 --> 41:44.785
Hello, Ms. Chen.

490
41:44.865 --> 41:47.145
Let me provide an update on the current plan.

491
41:47.745 --> 41:50.345
Gao Xing has only progressed to Compulsory Volume 1,

492
41:50.425 --> 41:52.625
so the concepts covered are relatively basic.

493
41:52.705 --> 41:54.945
I will later add Compulsory Volume 2 content

494
41:55.025 --> 41:57.345
to give Gao Xing a head start and ensure a smooth transition.

495
42:04.625 --> 42:05.945
YEAR 1 HIGH SCHOOL BIOLOGY EXAM

496
42:19.065 --> 42:20.225
Hello.

497
42:20.305 --> 42:22.585
Your assignment for tomorrow is in my bag.

498
42:22.665 --> 42:25.505
Ms. Zheng, how could you be so careless?

499
42:27.305 --> 42:29.825
Am I careless, or are you cunning?

500
42:29.905 --> 42:31.265
I'm bringing it back now.

501
42:31.345 --> 42:32.505
I'm not at home.

502
42:32.585 --> 42:35.145
I'm having dinner at my uncle's house. Right, Uncle?

503
42:35.225 --> 42:36.545
Yes.

504
42:36.625 --> 42:39.345
Why don't you leave it at my doorstep?

505
42:40.345 --> 42:41.705
I'm afraid if I do that,

506
42:41.785 --> 42:44.185
you will tell me tomorrow that it got blown away.

507
42:44.265 --> 42:47.225
Then come to my uncle's house. It's in the same area.

508
42:47.305 --> 42:48.585
In the same area?

509
42:48.665 --> 42:52.065
Yes, Building 14. I'll give you ten minutes.

510
42:52.145 --> 42:54.465
Ms. Zheng, hurry and run.

511
43:26.025 --> 43:27.025
Zheng Yu?
